# Section 8 (Platform pages): retired URLs, permanent. Cloudflare Workers Static
# Assets reads this file from the Worker's public/ directory (copied there by
# scripts/sync-to-worker.mjs) and applies it before any asset is looked up.
# Browsers keep the visitor's own #fragment through a 301 when the destination
# has none, so the tenant app's /abuse-mailbox#setup deep link still lands on
# the setup section. Each retired page also ships a src/pages stub (Redirect.astro)
# as a fallback for hosts that do not read this file.
/platform/ai-agents /platform#how-it-works 301
/platform/ai-agents/ /platform#how-it-works 301
/platform/social-monitoring /platform/impersonation 301
/platform/social-monitoring/ /platform/impersonation 301
/abuse-mailbox /platform/abuse-mailbox 301
/abuse-mailbox/ /platform/abuse-mailbox 301
